{"file": "我李长生重回八零，赶山狩猎养妻女-第162集.mp4", "ep": 162, "duration": 55.4, "segments": [{"start": 0.24, "end": 1.16, "text": "白晶海"}, {"start": 1.64, "end": 3.41, "text": "你"}, {"start": 5.22, "end": 6.18, "text": "回去告诉他"}, {"start": 6.99, "end": 8.55, "text": "靠山屯不欢迎外人"}, {"start": 8.99, "end": 14.43, "text": "长生哥"}, {"start": 14.55, "end": 15.43, "text": "他们真有图"}, {"start": 17.68, "end": 18.64, "text": "林子里的路"}, {"start": 19.0, "end": 20.08, "text": "不是拿张地图"}, {"start": 20.32, "end": 21.24, "text": "就能走通的"}, {"start": 21.88, "end": 27.49, "text": "告诉白晶阳"}, {"start": 29.02, "end": 30.7, "text": "老龙口的门槛太高"}, {"start": 31.22, "end": 33.15, "text": "他们卖不过去"}, {"start": 36.4, "end": 36.92, "text": "铁柱"}, {"start": 37.2, "end": 38.28, "text": "把他们身上的皮剥了"}, {"start": 38.48, "end": 38.96, "text": "哥"}, {"start": 39.24, "end": 39.96, "text": "剥皮"}, {"start": 40.2, "end": 41.08, "text": "这可是活人"}, {"start": 41.24, "end": 41.84, "text": "包装备"}, {"start": 42.08, "end": 42.64, "text": "枪收了"}, {"start": 42.64, "end": 43.2, "text": "衣服扒了"}, {"start": 43.2, "end": 43.72, "text": "鞋脱了"}, {"start": 43.72, "end": 44.84, "text": "秋衣秋裤给他们留着"}, {"start": 45.24, "end": 46.32, "text": "早这么说呀"}, {"start": 46.88, "end": 47.86, "text": "长生哥"}, {"start": 47.86, "end": 48.5, "text": "你摸摸"}, {"start": 48.9, "end": 50.26, "text": "比供销社的的确满还滑"}, {"start": 50.42, "end": 51.78, "text": "你们这是抢劫"}, {"start": 51.94, "end": 52.42, "text": "老实点"}, {"start": 53.12, "end": 54.4, "text": "近别人连着不交过路费"}, {"start": 54.48, "end": 55.28, "text": "你还有理了"}]}